F][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Registered errors and error-anchored launch logs[/bold #D7AFFF]              [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]registry[dim] · [dim][/dim]after keymap[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]registry: stamp every launch-failure log entry with a stable error id, [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]add the session-scoped registered-error pointer, make one helper both [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]register the error and emit its toast so the chord hint can never appear[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]without a target, and make `,L` select the registered error's log [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]source.[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF][/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  3 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Logs pane focuses the registered error entry[/bold #D7AFFF]                  [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]focus[dim] · [dim][/dim]after registry[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]focus: locate the registered error's anchor in a bounded tail scan, [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]render a window containing it with the entry line highlighted, scroll [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]the detail pane to it, and degrade with an in-pane notice when the entry[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]has aged out.[/#D7D7AF]","clan_tribe":"epic","epic_bead_id":"sase-qw","llm_provider":"claude","model":"sonnet","patch_name":"gh_sase-org__sase","phase_bead_id":"sase-qw.1","reasoning_effort":"high","vcs_provider":"GitHub"},"source_run_id":"run-0fd72150fadeae6850472396eccef10e","started_at":"2026-08-19T13:31:00.021916+00:00","state":"completed"},{"commits":[{"committed_at":1787157746,"sha":"422c8c2c57ad248a4e12e34c3e144eeb85ffb358","subject":"feat(logs): stamp launch failures with a session error id"}],"dismissed_at":null,"files":{"chat":{"digest":"785baf726c4845fb0b6a76f2f9ad121377bcb4250446f7f0c953d08d5926939e","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.sase-qw.2/chat.md","size_bytes":6662},"commits":{"digest":"498b685f0140dd30d20ae33c17d9c3104ced80141ebfee993